#: templates/pages/index.html:99
msgid "Free &amp; Open Source"
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/index.html:101
msgid ""
"Mixxx is free open-source software and entirely community-driven. There "
"is no company behind Mixxx &mdash; the development is shouldered by "
"passionate DJs and programmers that dedicate their free time to working "
"on their favorite DJ software. Mixxx is and always will be free!"
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/index.html:119
msgid "Latest News"
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/index.html:121
#, python-format
msgid ""
"To see a list of all news and announcements, head over to <a "
"href=\"%(SITEURL)s/news\">our news page</a> or subscribe to the <a "
"href=\"%(FEED_ATOM)s\">Atom feed</a>."
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/index.html:139
msgid "Friendly Community"
msgstr "Prijazna skupnost"

#: templates/pages/index.html:141
msgid ""
"Mixxx is developed by an international community of DJs, programmers, and"
" artists. Because Mixxx is <b>free (<a "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/philosophy/free-sw.html\">as in freedom</a> "
"and price), open source</b> software, anyone can contribute to make Mixxx"
" even better&mdash;including you!"
msgstr ""
"Mixxx razvija mednarodna skupnost didžejev, programerjev in umetnikov. "
"Ker je Mixxx brezplačen in svoboden odprtokodni program, lahko k "
"njegovemu razvoju prispeva kdorkoli - tudi vi!"

#: templates/pages/index.html:145
#, fuzzy, python-format
msgid ""
"You can get involved with Mixxx today by <a "
"href=\"%(github_issues)s\">reporting bugs and suggesting features</a>, <a"
" href=\"%(mapping_link)s\">making a controller mapping</a>, <a "
"href=\"%(create_a_branch_link)s\">adding features &amp; fixing bugs</a>, "
"<a href=\"%(help_with_translations_link)s\">helping with "
"translations</a>, or working on one of our other <a "
"href=\"%(starter_tasks_link)s\">starter tasks</a>."
msgstr ""
"Že danes se lahko pridružite Mixxxu in <a "
"href=\"%(github_issues)s\">poročate o hroščih in predlagate funkcije</a>,"
" <a href=\"%(mapping_link)s\">ustvarite mapiranje za kontroler</a>, <a "
"href=\"%(create_a_branch_link)s\">dodajate funkcije in odpravljate "
"hrošče</a>, <a href=\"%(help_with_translations_link)s\">pomagate pri "
"prevajanju</a>, ali delate na kakšni drugi <a "
"href=\"%(starter_tasks_link)s\">začetni nalogi</a>."

