"strojni opremi in mnogo več. Vsebuje tudi koristne podatke za "
"<b>začetnike</b> v razdelku <a "
"href=\"%(manual_beginner_link)s\">Didžejanje z Mixxx</a>."

#: templates/pages/support.html:20
#, fuzzy, python-format
msgid ""
"The <a href=\"%(mixxx_wiki_link)s\">Mixxx Wiki</a> has a wealth of useful"
" documentation for users and developers. New to it all and not sure how "
"to get started? Checkout the <a href=\"%(beginner_dj_links)s\">Beginner "
"DJ Links</a>. Running into technical issues? See the <a "
"href=\"%(wiki_troubleshooting)s\">Troubleshooting</a> guide."
msgstr ""
"Na <a href=\"%(mixxx_wiki_link)s\">Mixxx Wiki</a> se nahaja zdrava zbirka"
